  "description": "The most advanced library for managing Xbox XISO/XDVDFS disc images. C# port of extract-xiso (reference build 202609111233), extended with XboxKit archival (Redump video/filler/seed/wipe/trim/petrify/rebuild, ZAR), xdvdfs packing (build-image, CISO), disc/DAT inspection (`XisoDiscInfo`, `XisoDat`), skeleton overlay (`XisoSkeleton.Apply`), per-file hash sidecars, and parallel collection verbs. Reads plain ISO, split .1.iso sets, CISO, CCI/CCIM, GOD/SVOD and ZAR inputs through one detection layer, plus XBLA/XBLIG STFS package listing/extraction/validation and XContent title metadata, Xbox 360 XDBF/XSRC title metadata, and XBE logo/title/save images; packs to an explicit sector layout (`XisoLayoutSpec`/`--layout`), enforces Xbox name rules, and supports deterministic output. Supports RAW, GLOBAL, XGD1, XGD2, XGD3, and Hybrid disc layouts. Provides both synchronous and asynchronous APIs with cancellation support. Strong-named and trimmable, with an AOT-compatible library surface.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
